[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Resource_fallback"]
script = ExtResource("1_k14cx")
random_lines = Array[String](["I'm sick of this job at the shrine, if only Genshin wasn't here.", "Tomo do this Tomo do that, how about Genshin does it himself that old fart.", "I beg of you don't call Genshin “The hot shot” his ego will skyrocket. ", "You know, without that hat Genshin is the same size as Mio.", "I'm just trying to be a better man for my family. ", "Oh Shizu-hime up above, why must you punish me like this?", "I'm trying to figure out what's worse, working for Genshin or working for Ume?", "Who put Okabe in charge? He's nearly as useless as Genshin.", "I wish I could work with Tadashi or Kenji but I think their fiery spirit would roast me.", "Shizu-hime up above it's me Tomo. I'm trying to be a better man but Genshin is stopping me.", "How's Mio been doing? I think I'll skip my duties and go play with her.", "Kuro has been tracking mud over the shrine, I just can't hate him though. ", "Chiyo sure is a trooper, how did she live this long?", "I strive to cleanse myself of all my sins with the water of Shizu-hime.", "Did you know the rain is Shizu-hime's way of blessing us with growth and life.", "I nearly drowned after getting drunk. It was Shizu-hime who saved me.", "Genshin is in fact bald under his hat.", "Can you try to figure out just what's wrong with Ume?", "Working at a shrine would be awesome if there wasn't a certain someone.", "Mizuahara up above thank you for your blessing and everything you've done.", "Did you know men carved the river banks so the Shizu-hime could visit the villages.", "Did you know our body is made up of water? Shizu-hime blessed us with life. ", "I hope Shizu-hime can help Tadashi through his trying times. ", "I used to be a bum but now I'm a holy man. I hope to make my family proud. ", "Did you know Shizu-hime grew trees with her water so we could make Torii gates to visit her.", "I saw Tadashi and Kenji fighting earlier but I think they are secretly friends. ", "Genshin no chin chin wa chisai desu.", "Genshin should stop yelling at Sato for catching fish. The fish are clearly blessings.", "I believe Sato is a holy man as he's able to read and understand the mighty river.", "Hanae is such a good mother, may Shizu-hime bless her with a lasting life.", "Have you ever gone swimming in the river? It really makes you feel whole.", "Be careful heading down, the stairs are slippery.", "Make sure to wash your hands before praying."])
metadata/_custom_type_script = "uid://dn6pv6t3qvn8d"

